#: weathermap-cacti-plugin-editor.php
msgid ""
"<p><strong>Bandwidth:</strong> Set the capacity used to calculate link utilisation, for example 100M or 1G. K, M, G and T are supported. Use the same value for both directions unless their capacities differ.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Interface:</strong> Search by device, port or description, then select Use interface to fill the traffic source, click destination and hover graph together. Save applies the changes.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Comments:</strong> Add text to display along each direction of the link. The percentage controls its position along the line.</p>\n"
"<p><strong>Advanced:</strong> Use custom data sources or combine multiple sources, choose different graphs, change the click destination, or adjust line width and shape. Data Source(s) controls the measured traffic; Info URL(s) controls where a click goes; Hover Graph URL(s) controls the images shown on hover.</p>"
msgstr ""

